#### Get Chart Data

```
GET /api/comparison/chart/:chartType?company1=:name1&company2=:name2
```

Examples:

- `/api/comparison/chart/finances?company1=Apple&company2=Microsoft`
- `/api/comparison/chart/userMetrics?company1=Apple&company2=Microsoft`

### Health Check API

```
GET /api/health
```

Response:

