## **How the Tie-Breaker Works:**

1. **Detects Close Values**: If the two values are extremely close (difference is less than 0.1% of the larger value), it considers them effectively a tie.
 * In this case, 25.00% vs 25.00% is a perfect tie, so this condition is met.

