```"},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":""}],"tool_calls":[{"id":"toolu_014VTwbu3xkGpr8Ee2soxZ7s","type":"function","function":{"name":"edit_file","arguments":"{"target_file": "README.md", "instructions": "I'm updating the README file to reflect the new data source hierarchy where Yahoo Finance API is now the primary source, followed by CompaniesMarketCap, Gemini AI, Mistral AI, Alpha Vantage, and Wikipedia.", "code_edit": "# Competitor Analysis Scraper\n\nA robust backend system for scraping and comparing company data for competitor analysis with AI-powered data gathering\nand real-time financial accuracy.\n\n![Sample Comparison](https://via.placeholder.com/800x400?text=Competitor+Analysis+Dashboard)\n\n## Features\n\n- ** Yahoo Finance API Integration**: Primary comprehensive financial data source with real-time market information\n- ** Real-Time Financial Data**: Live market cap and stock prices from CompaniesMarketCap.com (10,000+ companies)\n- ** AI-Powered Data Collection**: Multi-tier AI integration with Gemini AI and Mistral AI for comprehensive analysis\n- ** Advanced Company Analysis**: Comprehensive data including financials, user metrics, strengths, weaknesses, and market position\n- ** Smart Visual Comparison**: Accurate charts with proper billion/million/trillion scaling\n- ** Intelligent Fallback System**: Multiple data sources ensure high availability and accuracy\n- ** Built-in UI**: Professional web interface for instant company comparisons\n- ** Responsive Design**: Mobile-friendly interface that adapts to all screen sizes\n- **⚡ Fast Performance**: Efficient caching system with intelligent source selection\n\n## ✨ Recent Updates\n\n### Latest Features (v2.2)\n\n- **Yahoo Finance API Primary**: Enhanced Yahoo Finance integration as the primary data source for comprehensive financial metrics\n- **Improved Data Hierarchy**: Reorganized data source priority for better accuracy and reliability\n- **Enhanced Financial Coverage**: Better P/E ratios, EPS, revenue, and profit margin data\n- **Faster Response Times**: Primary Yahoo Finance source provides quicker financial data access\n\n### Previous Updates (v2.1)\n- **Real-Time Market Data**: Added CompaniesMarketCap.com integration for live financial data\n- **Enhanced Accuracy**: Real-time market cap and stock prices for 10,000+ companies\n- **Improved Coverage**: Better data availability with additional fallback source\n- **No API Limits**: Free real-time data without rate restrictions\n\n### Previous Updates (v2.0)\n- **Gemini AI Integration**: AI data source providing comprehensive company intelligence\n- **Fixed Chart Scaling**: Proper visualization of billions, millions, and trillions\n- **Enhanced Data Quality**: More accurate financial metrics and user data\n- **Smart Source Priority**: Multi-tier fallback hierarchy for maximum reliability\n- **Improved Error Handling**: Better fallback mechanisms and data validation\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Windows\n\n1. Download or clone the repository\n2. Double-click `run-enhanced-server.bat`\n3. Open your browser to the URL shown (typically http://localhost:9000)\n4. Enter two company names to compare (e.g., \"Tesla\", \"Ford\")\n5. View comprehensive analysis with real-time financial data from Yahoo Finance\n\n### Other Platforms\n\n```bash\n# Clone repository\ngit clone https://github.com/Dabojit-sarkar-dev/Competitor-Analysis-Scraper.git\ncd Competitor-Analysis-Scraper\n\n# Run with Node.js\nnode src/enhanced-server.js\n```\n\n## API Keys Setup\n\nFor optimal performance, configure these API keys:\n\n### Optional for Enhanced Features:\n- **Gemini AI**: Get free key from [Google AI Studio](https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey)\n- **Mistral AI**: Get key from [Mistral AI Platform](https://console.mistral.ai/)\n- **Alpha Vantage**: Get free key from [Alpha Vantage](https://www.alphavantage.co/support/#api-key)\n\n**Note**: Yahoo Finance API and CompaniesMarketCap work without API keys!\n\n### Configuration Options:\n\n#### Option 1: Direct Configuration (Recommended)\nEdit `src/config.js`:\n```javascript\napi: {\n gemini: {\n key: 'your_gemini_api_key_here',\n enabled: true\n },\n mistral: {\n key: 'your_mistral_api_key_here', \n enabled: true\n },\n alphaVantage: {\n key: 'your_alpha_vantage_key_here'\n }\n}\n```\n\n#### Option 2: Environment Variables\n```bash\nset GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key_here\nset MISTRAL_API_KEY=your_mistral_key_here\nset ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY=your_alpha_vantage_key_here\n```\n\n#### Option 3: Batch File (Windows)\nEdit `run-enhanced-server.bat` and uncomment:\n```batch\nset GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_key_here\nset MISTRAL_API_KEY=your_mistral_key_here\nset ALPHA_VANTAGE_API_KEY=your_alpha_vantage_key_here\n```\n\n## Screenshots\n\n### Company Comparison\n\n![Company Comparison](https://via.placeholder.com/600x300?text=Yahoo+Finance+Powered+Analysis)\n\n### Financial Metrics with Proper Scaling\n\n![Financial Charts](https://via.placeholder.com/600x300?text=Real-Time+Financial+Charts)\n\n## ️ Tech Stack\n\n- **Node.js**: JavaScript runtime environment\n- **Core HTTP Module**: Native Node.js HTTP server (no Express dependency)\n- **Yahoo Finance API**: Primary comprehensive financial data source\n- **CompaniesMarketCap**: Real-time market cap and stock price data\n- **Gemini AI**: Secondary AI-enhanced comprehensive data gathering (Google)\n- **Mistral AI**: Tertiary AI-enhanced data gathering\n- **Alpha Vantage API**: Quaternary financial data and stock information\n- **Wikipedia API**: Basic company information and descriptions\n- **In-memory Database**: Fast responses with intelligent caching\n\n## Data Source Hierarchy\n\nThe system uses an intelligent multi-tier fallback approach for maximum accuracy and speed:\n\n1. ** Yahoo Finance API** (Primary): Comprehensive financial data including stock prices, market cap, P/E ratios, EPS, revenue, and profit margins\n2. ** CompaniesMarketCap** (Fallback 1): Real-time market cap and stock prices (10,000+ companies) when Yahoo Finance unavailable\n3. ** Gemini AI** (Fallback 2): Comprehensive company analysis with business intelligence, strengths/weaknesses, and strategic insights\n4. ** Mistral AI** (Fallback 3): Enhanced data gathering and business intelligence when Gemini fails\n5. ** Alpha Vantage** (Fallback 4): Professional financial data and stock information with detailed company overviews\n6. ** Wikipedia** (Fallback 5): Basic company information, descriptions, and logos\n\n### **Why This New Hierarchy Works Better:**\n\n- **Yahoo Finance Primary** provides comprehensive, reliable financial data without API limits\n- **Real-Time Backup** (CompaniesMarketCap) ensures current market data availability\n- **AI Intelligence** (Gemini/Mistral) adds strategic analysis and business insights\n- **Professional Data** (Alpha Vantage) offers structured financial information\n- **Broad Coverage** (Wikipedia) fills basic information gaps\n- **Maximum Reliability** with 6-tier fallback system\n\n## API Reference\n\n### Companies\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n|------------------------------|--------|------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| `/api/companies` | GET | List all companies in database |\n| `/api/companies/:identifier` | GET | Get details for a specific company (Yahoo Finance + AI-enhanced data) |\n\n### Comparisons\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n|---------------------------------------------------|--------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| `/api/comparison?company1=:name1&company2=:name2` | GET | Compare two companies with Yahoo Finance + AI analysis |\n| `/api/comparison/chart/finances` | GET | Financial performance chart data |\n| `/api/comparison/chart/usermetrics` | GET | User metrics chart data |\n\n### Health Checks\n\n| Endpoint | Method | Description |\n|---------------|--------|---------------------------------------------------|\n| `/api/health` | GET | Server health + API status + data source priority |\n\n### Example Requests\n\n```bash\n# Get company data (Yahoo Finance + AI-enhanced)\ncurl \"http://localhost:9000/api/companies/Tesla\"\n\n# Compare companies with real-time financial data\ncurl \"http://localhost:9000/api/comparison?company1=Apple&company2=Microsoft\"\n\n# Get financial chart data\ncurl \"http://localhost:9000/api/comparison/chart/finances?company1=Google&company2=Meta\"\n```\n\n## Running the Server\n\n### Windows (Recommended)\n\n```batch\nrun-enhanced-server.bat # Yahoo Finance + AI-powered version with real-time data\n```\n\n### Command Line (Any Platform)\n\n```bash\n# Navigate to project directory\ncd path/to/competitor-analysis-scraper\n\n# Run the enhanced server with Yahoo Finance + AI features\nnode src/enhanced-server.js\n```\n\n### Server Features:\n- ✅ Automatic port selection (9000, 9001, 9002, etc.)\n- ✅ Graceful shutdown and cleanup\n- ✅ Real-time logging and monitoring\n- ✅ API key validation and warnings\n- ✅ Multiple data source integration with smart prioritization\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\n├── logs/ # Automatic log files\n├── src/\n│ ├── config.js # API keys and configuration\n│ ├── enhanced-server.js # Main Yahoo Finance + AI-powered server\n│ ├── simple-server.js # Basic server (legacy)\n│ ├── controllers/ # Request handlers\n│ ├── models/ # Data models\n│ ├── routes/ # API routes\n│ ├── services/ # Financial and AI data services\n│ └── utils/ # Utilities and helpers\n├── public/ # Static web assets\n├── run-enhanced-server.bat # Windows launcher (Yahoo Finance + AI enabled)\n├── run-simple-server.bat # Basic launcher\n└── README.md # This documentation\n```\n\n## Recent Fixes & Enhancements\n\n### Yahoo Finance Primary Integration (v2.2.0)\n\n- ✅ **Yahoo Finance API Primary**: Comprehensive financial data as the main source\n- ✅ **Enhanced Financial Metrics**: Better P/E ratios, EPS, revenue, profit margins\n- ✅ **Faster Data Access**: Primary source provides quicker response times\n- ✅ **No API Limits**: Free access to comprehensive financial data\n- ✅ **Improved Stock Symbol Resolution**: Better company name to symbol mapping\n- ✅ **Enhanced Error Handling**: Robust fallback system with detailed logging\n\n### Real-Time Data Integration (v2.1.0)\n\n- ✅ **CompaniesMarketCap Integration**: Live market cap data for 10,000+ companies as fallback\n- ✅ **Real-Time Accuracy**: Current stock prices and market valuations\n- ✅ **Smart Name Processing**: Automatic company name normalization for URL generation\n- ✅ **Seamless Fallback**: Integrates smoothly with existing data sources\n\n### Chart Visualization Fix (v2.0.1)\n- ✅ **Proper Scaling**: Fixed billion/million/trillion chart scaling issue\n- ✅ **Accurate Proportions**: Charts now correctly show value relationships\n- ✅ **Unit Conversion**: Smart handling of T (trillion), B (billion), M (million)\n- ✅ **Visual Improvements**: Better bar sizing and minimum widths\n\n### AI Integration (v2.0.0)\n- ✅ **Gemini AI Secondary**: Comprehensive company intelligence as fallback\n- ✅ **Smart Fallbacks**: Automatic failover between data sources\n- ✅ **Enhanced Accuracy**: Better financial and user metrics\n- ✅ **Source Tracking**: Know which source provided your data\n\n## Data Quality & Coverage\n\nThe system provides exceptionally rich company data including:\n\n### ** Financial Metrics (Yahoo Finance Primary)**\n\n- **Comprehensive Stock Data**: Real-time prices, market cap, trading volumes\n- **Financial Ratios**: P/E ratios, EPS, profit margins, revenue data\n- **Market Performance**: Historical data and performance metrics\n- **Detailed Financials**: Income statements, balance sheets, cash flow\n\n### ** Real-Time Market Data (CompaniesMarketCap Fallback)**\n\n- **Live Market Cap**: Real-time market capitalization data\n- **Current Stock Prices**: Up-to-date pricing information\n- **Broad Coverage**: 10,000+ companies worldwide\n\n### ** User Analytics (AI-Enhanced)**\n\n- **Customer Counts**: User base size and demographics\n- **Growth Rates**: User acquisition and retention metrics\n- **Satisfaction Ratings**: Customer satisfaction scores\n\n### ** Strategic Analysis (AI-Powered)**\n\n- **SWOT Analysis**: Strengths, weaknesses, opportunities, threats\n- **Competitive Positioning**: Market position and competitive advantages\n- **Recent Developments**: Latest news and market movements\n\n### ** Company Intelligence**\n\n- **Corporate Details**: Founded date, headquarters, leadership\n- **Product Portfolio**: Main products and services with ratings\n- **Market Presence**: Industry classification and market segment\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| **Chart scaling wrong** | ✅ **Fixed in v2.0.1** - Charts now properly scale B/M/T values |\n| **Outdated financial data** | ✅ **Fixed in v2.2** - Yahoo Finance provides real-time financial data |\n| **Limited company data** | Yahoo Finance works without API keys; configure Gemini for AI analysis |\n| **API rate limits** | Yahoo Finance has no limits; system falls back automatically |\n| **Port conflicts** | Server tries multiple ports automatically (9000-9003) |\n| **Slow initial response** | Yahoo Finance is fast; AI requests take 3-5 seconds (normal) |\n| **No financial data** | Check if company has a stock symbol; system will try name search |\n| **Missing AI insights** | Configure Gemini/Mistral API keys for enhanced business intelligence |\n\n### API Key Verification:\n\nVisit `http://localhost:9000/api/health` to check all data sources:\n\n```json\n{\n \"apis\": {\n \"gemini\": true, // ✅ Gemini AI working (secondary)\n \"mistral\": true, // ✅ Mistral AI working (tertiary) \n \"alphaVantage\": true // ✅ Alpha Vantage working (quaternary)\n },\n \"dataSourcePriority\": [\n \"Yahoo Finance API\", // ✅ PRIMARY\n \"CompaniesMarketCap (Real-time)\", // ✅ FALLBACK 1\n \"Gemini AI\", // ✅ FALLBACK 2\n \"Mistral AI\", // ✅ FALLBACK 3\n \"Alpha Vantage\", // ✅ FALLBACK 4\n \"Wikipedia\" // ✅ FALLBACK 5\n ]\n}\n```\n\n## **What Makes This Special:**\n\n### ** Unique Features:**\n\n- **Yahoo Finance Primary**: Comprehensive financial data without API limits as main source\n- **6-Tier Fallback System**: Yahoo Finance → CompaniesMarketCap → Gemini AI → Mistral AI → Alpha Vantage → Wikipedia\n- **Real-Time + AI Hybrid**: Combines real-time financial data with AI business intelligence\n- **Zero Configuration Required**: Yahoo Finance and CompaniesMarketCap work out-of-the-box\n- **Comprehensive Coverage**: Financial metrics + business intelligence + market data\n\n### ** Perfect For:**\n\n- **Financial Analysis**: Real-time comprehensive financial data from Yahoo Finance\n- **Investment Research**: Detailed company financials and AI-powered insights\n- **Competitive Analysis**: Side-by-side comparisons with live data and strategic analysis\n- **Market Monitoring**: Track real-time financial metrics and market movements\n- **Academic Research**: Rich datasets combining financial data with business intelligence\n\n## Contributing\n\nContributions welcome! Areas of high interest:\n\n- Enhanced Yahoo Finance data extraction\n- Additional real-time data sources\n- New AI integrations\n- Enhanced visualization types\n- Performance optimizations\n- Alternative financial data sources\n\n1. Fork the repository\n2. Create feature branch: `git checkout -b feature/amazing-feature`\n3. Commit changes: `git commit -m 'Add amazing feature'`\n4. Push to branch: `git push origin feature/amazing-feature`\n5. Open Pull Request\n\n## License\n\nMIT License - see [LICENSE](LICENSE) file for details.\n\n## Acknowledgments\n\n- **Yahoo Finance** for providing comprehensive financial data as our primary source\n- **CompaniesMarketCap.com** for real-time market cap and stock price data\n- **Google Gemini AI** for comprehensive company intelligence and business insights\n- **Mistral AI** for enhanced data gathering capabilities\n- **Alpha Vantage** for professional financial market data\n- **Wikipedia** for open company information\n- All contributors and users providing feedback\n\n---\n\n**Ready to analyze competitors with comprehensive financial data?** Run `run-enhanced-server.bat` and visit http://localhost:9000 \n\n### **Experience the power of Yahoo Finance + AI-driven analysis!**"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_014VTwbu3xkGpr8Ee2soxZ7s","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

